                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I'm proud to have secured $2 million for the Jones Regional Medical Center to build a permanent advanced simulation lab that will train more nurses right here at home.\n\nOur rural communities depend on highly skilled nurses, and this investment ensures we can train the best of the best in Jones County. This funding strengthens our healthcare workforce, expands opportunity, and keeps high-quality care close to home.",
