                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The ribbon cutting for the new Meller Health Center and Lee County EMS facility marks a major milestone for the community. I secured $2.1 million in FY23 Community Project Funding for the EMS Bay Improvement Project, giving the Lee County Health Department its first independent base of operations in more than three decades.\n\nThis project has been important to the community and to me, and I\u2019m grateful to support investments that strengthen public health, enhance emergency services, and help Lee County continue to grow.",
