                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "As a physician, I understand how critical access to local care is for rural communities.\n\nThat\u2019s why I\u2019m proud to have secured nearly $3 million in Community Project Funding for Lee County health services. With the opening of the Mellar Family Health Center, EMS bay improvements, and our ongoing push to reopen Keokuk Hospital, we are delivering reliable, high-quality care close to home.",
