                "text": "We need to lower healthcare costs for EVERYONE.\n\nThe Unaffordable Care Act (Obamacare) promised Americans lower premiums, but delivered higher costs, fewer choices, sky-high deductibles, and more profitable medical insurance companies. https://t.co/YDPvtsTdP9",
