                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Iowans are sick of paying more for coverage they can\u2019t use. As a physician and the only former state public health director in Congress, I\u2019m proud to lead a plan that lowers premiums, cracks down on fraud, reins in PBMs, and finally puts you and your doctors in control of your healthcare.",
